    "focus": "Implement approved ISSUE-fcfdd50de84fb31a: decode socket and child-process output as UTF-8 streams so multibyte characters split across reads survive intact. Preserve framing and byte-based limits. Reuse the established streaming decoder in src/mcp/forward-step.ts; cover each corrected reader with split-chunk regressions.",
    "producesLld": false,
    "commit": "3251877d3",
    "tasks": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "passed": true
      }
    ],
    "summary": "Added a shared StringDecoder-based reader preserving raw byte counts and applied it to daemon/shared/MCP sockets, subprocess tool output, Graphviz and editor CLI stderr; workflow streaming preserves its named listener and uses StringDecoder directly, and CLI stdout uses Node UTF-8 stream decoding. Split-byte regressions cover all corrected reader families. Backend and editor TypeScript passed; expanded compatibility suite: 150 pass, 0 fail.",
